+/add nlog.config
+I installed Seq. Update nlog.config to add the Seq extension and target. 1) Inside <nlog>, add <extensions><add assembly="NLog.Targets.Seq"/></extensions>. 2) Add a new target: <target xsi:type="Seq" name="seq" serverUrl="http://localhost:5341" />. 3) In the <rules> section, add <logger name="*" minlevel="Info" writeTo="seq" /> so logs go to both the file and the Seq dashboard.

